# Dry fountain (R23 plaza, monument): a round kerb-stone basin with a cracked dark pool and a stepped centre column.
grid 10
size 40 40 16
slot stone Kerb
slot pool WindowOff
slot column Trim
cyl 20 20 0 3 19.5 stone
carve cyl 20 20 1 3 17.5
cyl 20 20 1 2 17.5 pool
noise 0.12 6 pool
cyl 20 20 1 8 4 stone
cyl 20 20 8 11 3 column
cyl 20 20 11 13 5 stone
cyl 20 20 13 15 1.5 column
